  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUse your calculator to convert the quantities to a common unit of measure. Then express the ratio as a fraction.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ci\u003e192 ounces to \u003cimg width\u003d\"25\" height\u003d\"41\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_6_1_proportionsandratios_6_50/image010.gif\" class\u003d\"middle\"\u003e gallons\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eConvert gallons to ounces.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eIt is easier to convert the gallons to ounces and simplify the fraction.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"164\" height\u003d\"41\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_6_1_proportionsandratios_6_50/image011.gif\" class\u003d\"middle\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18424\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18425\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qdot.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18425\u0026quot;,135)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18426\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q5.gif\"\u003e on your calculator. To convert from gallons to ounces, press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18427\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18428\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qconvert.gif\"\u003e, select \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18429\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q3.gif\"\u003e for volume, then select \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18430\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e for gallons, and then select \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18431\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q5.gif\"\u003e for ounces.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-1 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_6_1_proportionsandratios_6_50/f-50-6-1-anim.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18432\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18432\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18433\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18433\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe calculator tells us that 2.5 gallons make 320 ounces.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_6_1_proportionsandratios_6_50/f-50-6-2.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eEnter the ratio using the \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18434\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qfrac.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18434\u0026quot;,154)\"\u003e key to simplify.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eWe have to simplify the ratio\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"80\" height\u003d\"41\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_6_1_proportionsandratios_6_50/image012.gif\" class\u003d\"middle\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eKey in the ratio \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18435\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18436\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q9.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18437\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18438\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qfrac.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18438\u0026quot;,154)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18439\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q3.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18440\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18441\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q0.gif\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_6_1_proportionsandratios_6_50/f-50-6-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18442\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18442\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18443\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18443\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe calculator gives the value 3/5.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"107\" height\u003d\"61\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_6_1_proportionsandratios_6_50/image013.gif\" class\u003d\"text-top\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-7 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_6_1_proportionsandratios_6_50/f-50-6-4.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
